AbsCtlPlaced.cfg MCTxAbs expect=violate:Conservation timeout=3600 why=control: a Commit before every Tent of its attempt reported mine breaks a property
ApaTxAbs.tla abs-ind-CtlLow expect=violate:IndInv timeout=3600 tool=apalache args=--cinit=CtlLow --init=IndInit --next=Next --inv=IndInv --length=1 why=control: a Commit whose debit on the decider is not covered; the induction needs the guard
