AbsCtlFence.cfg MCTxAbs expect=violate:Conservation timeout=3600 why=control: a Commit over a fence of its attempt, or a final one breaks a property
ApaTxAbs.tla abs-ind-CtlGiveUp expect=violate:IndInv timeout=3600 tool=apalache args=--cinit=CtlGiveUp --init=IndInit --next=Next --inv=IndInv --length=1 why=control: a coordinator gives up an attempt that committed; the induction needs the guard
AbsCtlGiveUp.cfg MCTxAbs expect=violate:Conservation timeout=3600 why=control: a coordinator gives up an attempt that committed breaks a property
ApaTxAbs.tla abs-ind-CtlGone expect=violate:IndInv timeout=3600 tool=apalache args=--cinit=CtlGone --init=IndInit --next=Next --inv=IndInv --length=1 why=control: a Tent on a key that forgot the name; the induction needs the guard
